    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.poster.avif?t=1755535897\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.webm?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.mp4?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the champion that suits you from 20 legends and build your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from realm to realm and hunt down corrupted enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your strategic genius on the battlefield with the turn-based combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your team members in your own unique way. Customize the equipment and features suitable for each member with gold, skill books and monster essences that you will obtain from the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive to avoid going back to the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on optional quests and puzzles in realms and watch out for traps in some areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy corrupted special, elite and boss type enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realms Road awaits you with its fluid story with its unique champions, loyal companions, equipment that you can choose according to your playing style, different realm quests and various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.poster.avif?t=1755535897\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.webm?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.mp4?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.poster.avif?t=1755535897\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.webm?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/f0ad8387ca0c2a5e5c2abc55b8a91544.mp4?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the champion that suits you from 20 legends and build your team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from realm to realm and hunt down corrupted enemies one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your strategic genius on the battlefield with the turn-based combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your team members in your own unique way. Customize the equipment and features suitable for each member with gold, skill books and monster essences that you will obtain from the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to survive to avoid going back to the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on optional quests and puzzles in realms and watch out for traps in some areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy corrupted special, elite and boss type enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realms Road awaits you with its fluid story with its unique champions, loyal companions, equipment that you can choose according to your playing style, different realm quests and various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.poster.avif?t=1755535897\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.webm?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805340/extras/0ef285790e27ab35dc0854f820140e15.mp4?t=1755535897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "REALMS ROAD includes turn-based RPG, rogue-like and adventure elements. Players will find themselves in crazy fights in various lands by choosing the right champion and party members. With deep character customization and a semi-automatic battle system, REALMS ROAD awaits all adventurers.",
